&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;118&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;121&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;198&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;153&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote within Italy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;198&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;201&quot; data-end=&quot;215&quot;&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in Italian, and English. Further languages are a real advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;349&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;314&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years in outbound sales roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;352&quot; data-end=&quot;398&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;352&quot; data-end=&quot;363&quot;&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €38,000 – €45,000 gross annually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;437&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;414&quot;&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time, permanent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;444&quot; data-end=&quot;502&quot;&gt;🚀 Join fiskaly! Help Us Simplify Receipts for Millions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;504&quot; data-end=&quot;703&quot;&gt;Millions of people interact with fiskaly every day, even if they don’t realize it. As a B2B company, we power the retail technology behind digital receipts and secure, legally compliant transactions.&amp;nbsp;In Italy, we help retailers go fully digital and eliminate the need for hardware like fiscal printers to issue and manage receipts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;By making receipts tamper-proof through digital signatures, we help fight tax fraud. And with our paperless receipt solution, we offer consumers a modern alternative while helping merchants streamline their operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1058&quot; data-end=&quot;1151&quot;&gt;Sure, our solutions sound complex but our mission is simple: make receipts easy for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1158&quot; data-end=&quot;1172&quot;&gt;💼 The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:137;1149-1285&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll drive new business: POS vendors, software agencies and retail tech providers who need fiscal compliance built into their product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:266;1287-1552&quot;&gt;This is an outbound-heavy role, but we do it the smart way. You won&#39;t spend hours manually researching email addresses. You&#39;ll use sales intelligence and AI tools to build targeted lists, craft hyper-personalised outreach and get in front of decision-makers faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;25:1-25:74;1554-1627&quot;&gt;Your job is to build a qualified pipeline that fuels our European growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1655&quot; data-end=&quot;1676&quot;&gt;🛠️ What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:175;1652-1826&quot;&gt;Run a high-volume, high-quality outbound motion, identifying and contacting decision-makers — CTOs, Product Managers, Heads of Product — at software companies across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;30:1-30:91;1827-1917&quot;&gt;Own the full sales cycle for mid-market accounts, and qualification for enterprise deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-31:148;1918-2065&quot;&gt;Use AI writing assistants and sales intelligence tools (LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Apollo) to research prospects and personalise outreach at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;32:1-32:137;2066-2202&quot;&gt;Run discovery calls that get to the real technical and commercial pain — why the current integration is failing, and what it&#39;s costing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;33:1-33:89;2203-2291&quot;&gt;Work with Marketing to sharpen messaging so the value proposition lands in your market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;34:1-34:60;2292-2351&quot;&gt;Keep impeccable CRM hygiene so forecasting stays accurate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;35:1-35:56;2352-2407&quot;&gt;Represent fiskaly at retail-tech events across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2153&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;👀 What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;39:1-45:79;2431-3198&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;39:1-39:102;2431-2532&quot;&gt;5+ years in outbound sales or business development (SDR / BDR / AE), ideally in SaaS or retail tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;40:1-40:105;2533-2637&quot;&gt;Fluent in Italian, and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;41:1-41:134;2638-2771&quot;&gt;Native-level command of at least one other European language, because you&#39;ll be selling to software companies in their own language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;42:1-42:114;2772-2885&quot;&gt;A hunter mentality, with a track record of building your own pipeline and hitting outreach targets consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;43:1-43:86;2886-2971&quot;&gt;Tech-savvy: comfortable in a modern sales stack, and eager to use AI to move faster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;44:1-44:148;2972-3119&quot;&gt;Curiosity: you grasp technical concepts quickly. You don&#39;t need to be a developer, but you need to understand why an API beats a physical printer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;45:1-45:79;3120-3198&quot;&gt;A proactive, organised approach — you create leads rather than wait for them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;47:1-47:20;3200-3219&quot;&gt;🌍 Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;49:1-51:60;3221-3515&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;49:1-49:136;3221-3356&quot;&gt;Additional European languages. Every extra one widens the set of prospects you can open and the colleagues you can work with directly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;50:1-50:99;3357-3455&quot;&gt;Experience selling into more than one European market, or to companies expanding internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;51:1-51:60;3456-3515&quot;&gt;Exposure to regulated or compliance-driven software sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2723&quot; data-end=&quot;2741&quot;&gt;✅ What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2873&quot; data-end=&quot;3275&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2873&quot; data-end=&quot;2951&quot;&gt;A team that gives you space to grow, take ownership, and learn from trying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2952&quot; data-end=&quot;2981&quot;&gt;22 vacation days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2982&quot; data-end=&quot;3032&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours and a hybrid work setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3033&quot; data-end=&quot;3085&quot;&gt;Budget for personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3086&quot; data-end=&quot;3138&quot;&gt;Hardware of your choice (Windows, Linux, or Mac)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3196&quot; data-end=&quot;3275&quot;&gt;A company culture that values clarity, well-being, and good work over noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;3282&quot; data-end=&quot;3299&quot;&gt;✨ Why fiskaly?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3301&quot; data-end=&quot;3520&quot;&gt;We work on real problems that have impact, not vanity projects. Our team is pragmatic, direct, and focused on building solid tech for an industry that needs it. We care about how things work, not how they look on paper.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3522&quot; data-end=&quot;3576&quot;&gt;If that resonates, you’ll probably enjoy working here.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;118&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;121&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt; Account Executive – New Business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote within Spain, Germany, Austria, Italy or Poland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Full professional English and Portuguese&lt;/strong&gt;. Any other European language spoken in our markets (e.g. Spanish, German, Italian, French, Polish) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 5 years in B2B sales with a clear focus on outbound&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €40,000 – €50,000 gross/year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Join fiskaly! Finance that looks forward, not just backward.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At fiskaly, innovation drives us. We&#39;re reshaping the landscape of fiscal compliance with our cloud-based solutions for electronic receipts and invoices. Our team thrives on diversity and collaboration, committed to creating a supportive environment where everyone&#39;s contributions are valued. Join us to play a key role in our mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💼 &lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Account Executive – New Business to build a pipeline and close business in new markets. This is an outbound-first role: you will open doors that are not yet open, through cold calling, email, video, LinkedIn and whatever creative prospecting gets you in front of the right person. You own the opportunity from first touch to signature, and you stay close to your customers after the deal is done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be selling into POS providers, billing and invoicing software vendors, ERP partners and retail technology companies — technical buyers who care about API quality and business buyers who care about staying on the right side of the law. Both conversations are yours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🛠️ &lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own pipeline through consistent, high-quality outbound activity: cold calls, sequenced email, video, LinkedIn and creative prospecting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the full funnel: prospecting, discovery, solution mapping, negotiation, contract signing and post-sale support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the funnel moving: open new opportunities while advancing the deals already in play, with the discipline to do both every week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become genuinely credible on the fiscalization and e-invoicing regulations in your markets, so you can answer legal and basic technical questions without needing to escalate every time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate a technical API product into clear business value for non-technical buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Legal and Solution Engineering on the questions that genuinely need them, and bring the market&#39;s objections back into the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep your pipeline data clean and your forecast honest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;👀 &lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years in B2B sales with a strong outbound track record — you have built pipeline from nothing, not just worked inbound leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full professional English and Portuguese&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any other European language spoken in one of our markets is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credible presence: you can hold a room with a CFO, a product lead and a developer in it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A very good listener — you ask the second and third question, not just the first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methodical and self-directed, with the discipline to keep activity consistent when nobody is checking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to explain complex, regulated topics simply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset: you enjoy an environment where the playbook is still being written and you are expected to help write it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, competitive and coachable, and honest about what you don&#39;t know yet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It will really impress us if you already have experience in the VAT world — e-invoicing, fiscal reporting or tax compliance software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International experience in a European startup or scaleup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in compliance, accounting, billing software, POS or PMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling an API-based or otherwise technical product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;✅ &lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vacation days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours and a hybrid setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget for personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware of your choice (Windows/Mac)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that is open, direct, and pragmatic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;Why fiskaly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining fiskaly means contributing to a mission-driven company that is redefining how compliance is done in Europe and beyond. Here, you&#39;ll grow, innovate, and make a real impact on the finance operations of a scaling SaaS company.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Job Details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote but based in the country we operate: Austria, Germany, Spain, Italy, or Poland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; English (professional); Italian, German, French, or Spanish is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 2+ years with product certification frameworks (Common Criteria, FIPS 140-3, SESIP, EU CRA, BSI TR) as a certifier, evaluator, or developer submitting a product for evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; 60K - 70K&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time, permanent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🚀 Join fiskaly! Help Us Simplify Tax Compliance for Millions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people interact with fiskaly every day, even if they never notice it. We&#39;re the company behind compliance at the point of sale and e-invoicing — the invisible layer that keeps receipts tamper-proof, fights tax fraud, and helps merchants across Europe ditch paper for good.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It&#39;s B2B, it&#39;s regulatory, and yes, it&#39;s complex. But our mission is simple: make tax compliance easy for everyone. If you want to build the infrastructure that quietly powers commerce for millions — you&#39;re in the right place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💼 The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In several of our markets, a fiskaly product cannot go live until it has passed evaluation against frameworks such as the BSI Technical Guidelines or Common Criteria — and every change to the framework or to the product can reopen that question. Someone has to work out what the framework now requires, get the artifacts and product changes ready, and steer the certification through evaluators, consultants, and certification bodies whose timelines rarely match ours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Certification Engineer, that is your job, end to end. You derive requirements with Product Managers, prepare the evidence with the development teams, keep the external process moving when the other side goes quiet, and make sure the rest of fiskaly understands what a certification will take before it shows up in a roadmap as a surprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A typical week&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily or weekly syncs with a product team (engineers and product manager)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emails and calls with evaluators, certification bodies, and consultants on open certification topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updating the status of each certification and its open items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing and reviewing evaluation documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer calls where you join as the compliance expert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working out product requirements together with Product Managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🛠️ What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Managers to derive what each certification framework requires of the product, and track changes in requirements and evaluation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Together with Product Managers and development teams, prepare the required artifacts and drive the product changes needed ahead of each certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep evaluators, certification bodies, and consultants engaged and on schedule; clear blockers before they turn into delays, and propose alternatives when the other side stalls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own certification documentation — evaluation reports, compliance records, and instructional references — with consistent structure, traceability, and version control, so artifacts are reusable and reduce rework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep a current, single-source record of each certification&#39;s status, communications, and outstanding work items, so work continues if you&#39;re unavailable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively brief development teams and internal stakeholders (product, engineering, IMS/compliance, legal, sales, CS) on status, key communications, and upcoming tasks — in terms each of them can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Product Managers, engineers, and fellow Certification Managers on certification processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute feedback on proposed regulatory changes and recommendations to government bodies, coordinated with Product Managers and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent fiskaly at conferences, industry bodies, and special-interest groups (with colleagues as needed) to build relationships with domain experts and strengthen fiskaly&#39;s presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to analyze regulatory documents, compose evaluation artifacts, and track compliance between implementation and certification requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;👀 What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years working with national or international product certification frameworks — Common Criteria, FIPS 140-3, SESIP, EU CRA, or BSI Technical Guidelines — as a certifier, evaluator, or a developer submitting a product for evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong background in computer science, information security, or a related field, through professional experience, formal studies, or both&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication: you document and explain complex facts accurately and clearly, and adjust to the audience — evaluator, engineer, or sales colleague&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to analyze regulatory requirements, evaluate technical options, and produce structured, clearly written documentation others can act on — and to spread that knowledge through the organization rather than keep it in your head&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills: you spot problems before they land, structure your own workload, and improve or build internal processes where they&#39;re missing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Patience with slow, uncooperative, or unrealistic counterparts: you keep proposing options and don&#39;t treat silence as a stop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-first way of working: you understand what AI does well and badly in software development and compliance, and already use it to analyze regulatory texts, draft evaluation artifacts, and track compliance between implementation and requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional English (our working language)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Italian, German, French, or Spanish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;✅ What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that gives you space to grow, take ownership, and learn from trying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vacation days per year if you&#39;re based in Austria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours and a hybrid work setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget for personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware of your choice (Windows, Linux, or Mac)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that values clarity, well-being, and good work over noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;✨ Why fiskaly?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work on real problems that have impact, not vanity projects. Our team is pragmatic, direct, and focused on building solid tech for an industry that needs it. We care about how things work, not how they look on paper.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If that resonates, you&#39;ll probably enjoy working here.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt; Head of Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid set up in Vienna&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Full professional English&lt;/strong&gt;. Any other European language spoken in our markets (e.g. Spanish, German, Italian, French, Polish) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 5 years leading software engineers, plus at least 3 managing engineering&amp;nbsp;managers or team leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Join fiskaly! Help Us Simplify Receipts for Millions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people interact with fiskaly every day, even if they don’t realize it. As a B2B company, we power the retail technology behind digital receipts and secure, legally compliant transactions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By making receipts tamper-proof through digital signatures, we help fight tax fraud. And with our paperless receipt solution, we offer consumers a modern alternative while helping merchants streamline their operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sure, our solutions sound complex but our mission is simple: make receipts easy for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead our engineering organisation: 5 Engineering Managers and roughly 70 engineers across Vienna, Warsaw and remote, building the products, backend services and platforms behind our fiscalization platform. The Engineering Managers report to you directly. You&#39;re accountable for the strength of that management layer, for how engineering operates as a whole - planning, capacity, hiring, performance, reliability - and for what actually ships, on&amp;nbsp;the dates regulators set.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an operational leadership role. The technical direction of individual services sits with&amp;nbsp;your Engineering Managers and their dev leads; you own the system that turns a roadmap&amp;nbsp;into shipped, compliant software. Product is part of the same organisation, not a counterpart&amp;nbsp;across a wall: product managers sit with the teams, and you and the Product lead share one&amp;nbsp;roadmap, one planning cadence, and one definition of shipped. You report to the Co-CEO&lt;br&gt;and work day to day with your Engineering Managers, the Product lead, Platform and the&amp;nbsp;team in Warsaw.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The stack is Go, inside a distributed system, running in regulated, high-SLA environments&amp;nbsp;across several European markets, each with its own rules and deadlines. Your Engineering&amp;nbsp;Managers own their teams. You own that they&#39;re good at it - and that the machine works&amp;nbsp;across teams: dependencies don&#39;t fall between them, capacity follows the roadmap,&amp;nbsp;incidents get closed rather than survived, and a regulatory date six months out becomes a&amp;nbsp;plan people can execute against. Problems here arrive as dates, dependencies, and&amp;nbsp;trade-offs, rarely as clean tickets. A real part of the job is turning them into an operating&amp;nbsp;rhythm the whole organisation can plan against.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🛠️ What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People: &lt;/strong&gt;hiring, developing, and holding accountable your Engineering Managers -&amp;nbsp;1:1s, feedback that lands, calibration across their teams so &quot;good&quot; means the same&amp;nbsp;in Vienna and Warsaw, performance issues addressed early at the manager level&amp;nbsp;too. You own the headcount plan and the hiring bar for the whole organisation. We&amp;nbsp;expect you to build a management layer people want to work for, where delivery&amp;nbsp;pressure never costs trust or psychological safety in any team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; you don&#39;t set the direction of individual services -you enable your teams&amp;nbsp;to do so with their EM and teach leads. You own that it gets set deliberately and&amp;nbsp;coherently across teams: one platform across markets rather than a stack per&amp;nbsp;country, tech debt managed as a portfolio, engineering health measured and trending&amp;nbsp;the right way organisation-wide. Plus agentic engineering as an enabler for faster&amp;nbsp;delivery, higher quality and innovative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process:&lt;/strong&gt; the operating system of engineering - how the organisation plans, allocates&amp;nbsp;capacity, delivers, and reflects. One planning cadence every team runs on, flow and&amp;nbsp;capacity signals every EM reads the same way, and room for teams to differ where it&amp;nbsp;helps. Throughput per engineer is yours too: AI-assisted development is part of how&amp;nbsp;we work, and where it earns its place is your call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; the roadmap and the regulatory calendar across all teams, together with the Product lead inside the same organisation. You turn dates set by legislators into multi-quarter plans the organisation can execute against, make capacity follow the roadmap, and surface risk to the Co-CEO and the management team while there is still time to act. You make technical reality legible at organisation level - to Product, Compliance, Customer Support, Sales, and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality and reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; the reliability posture of the whole platform. Prevention with SRE and QE, incident management as a system rather than a heroics roster - sustainable on-call, consistent severity handling, postmortem actions that close&amp;nbsp;across teams - and the reliability numbers customers, auditors, and certification bodies ask about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; you run the Engineering Leadership Team - your EMs, and tech leads - and you own what happens between teams: dependencies that would otherwise fall through, practices that should spread, decisions that need one owner. The new Warsaw Office is in that forum from day one, and you represent engineering to the rest of fiskaly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👀 What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An engineering background. You came up as a software engineer and have stayed&amp;nbsp;close enough to the craft to make sound calls, spot a weak technical argument, and&amp;nbsp;earn the trust of the senior engineers and managers who report to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years leading software engineers, plus at least 3 managing engineering&amp;nbsp;managers or team leads. You have built a management layer, not just a team - hired&amp;nbsp;managers, developed them, and dealt with it when one wasn&#39;t working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering outcomes through an organisation of several teams, over&amp;nbsp;multiple quarters, against deadlines you didn&#39;t set - regulatory, contractual, or&amp;nbsp;otherwise fixed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running services in a distributed system under real reliability constraints.&amp;nbsp;You have owned an SLA, and the incident and on-call process behind it, for more&amp;nbsp;than one team at a time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An operating cadence you have built yourself: how several teams plan, allocate&amp;nbsp;capacity, deliver, and reflect, with flow and reliability signals everyone reads the same&amp;nbsp;way. You know which parts to standardise and which to leave to the teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credible technical challenge. You don&#39;t need to write the code, but you can question&amp;nbsp;an architecture direction across teams, weigh trade-offs, and tell a real constraint&amp;nbsp;from a preference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication, including making engineering legible to&amp;nbsp;people who don&#39;t share your background - Product, Sales, Customer Support, leadership, and the occasional auditor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort setting direction with incomplete information, and holding it across teams once it&#39;s set.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm and direct under pressure - in incidents, in difficult performance conversations with managers, and in trade-off conversations with Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading across locations. You have run teams that don&#39;t sit in the same office, and you know what it takes to make a second site a real part of the organisation rather than an annex.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English (company language)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🌍 Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated or compliance-sensitive domains: fiscalisation, e-invoicing,&amp;nbsp;payments, fintech, healthtech or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go, distributed systems, observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having led an engineering organisation - not just a team - through a significant phase&amp;nbsp;shift: a re-org, a platform migration, a reliability turnaround, or a step change in size.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale-up experience where the org changed shape underneath you, ideally as the&amp;nbsp;one who reshaped it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having built up a second engineering site, or integrated one into an existing&amp;nbsp;organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having been through technical due diligence, from either side.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with agentic workflows or LLM-assisted development, and a&amp;nbsp;view on how they change the way an engineering organisation should be run.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German, Polish, or other European languages. English is our working language, and&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re on our way to becoming the leading compliance suite across all 27 EU member&amp;nbsp;states - and every additional language gets you closer to a team, a regulator, or a&amp;nbsp;customer somewhere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅ What We Offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company in an unusual position for a scale-up: growing fast, cash-flow positive,&amp;nbsp;and in a market where growth is written into law - you build, you don&#39;t rescue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leadership role with real scope: the engineering organisation, its people, and its standard are yours to shape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short decision paths: you are part of the Company Leadership Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An amazing office in the heart of Vienna plus hybrid setup and flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget for personal and professional development, plus monthly time set aside to&amp;nbsp;use it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware of your choice: Windows, Linux, or Mac&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vacation days - and Christmas to New Year&#39;s fully off on top, no vacation days needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical option for personal projects or learning, and one paid volunteering day per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fiskalversary bonuses at 3, 5, and 7 years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension fund contributions of up to 10%, or €25/month into Zukunftssicherung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Wiener Linien ticket or part of your Klimaticket&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to €100/month in meal vouchers, and bike leasing via salary conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free on-site occupational health services and OpenUp - professional mental health support, anytime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly fiskaly Breakfast in every office, CorpLife discounts, and an international team of more than 30 nationalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation allowance for your move to Vienna for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✨ Why fiskaly?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work on real problems that have impact, not vanity projects. Our team is pragmatic, direct, and focused on building solid tech for an industry that needs it. We care about how things work, not how they look on paper. If that resonates, you’ll probably enjoy working here.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Vienna — hybrid, with regular on-site presence (and full on-site presence during audits)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Languages: English (C1); German is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 5+ years in Information Security, Compliance or GRC, incl. at least one ISO 27001 audit cycle owned end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: Competitive, based on experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract: Full-time, permanent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Join fiskaly! Help Us Build Trust in Compliance &amp;amp; Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people interact with fiskaly every day, even if they don&#39;t realize it. As a B2B company, we power the retail technology behind digital receipts and secure, legally compliant transactions.&lt;br&gt;By making receipts tamper-proof through digital signatures, we help fight tax fraud. And with our paperless receipt solution, we offer consumers a modern alternative while helping merchants streamline their operations.&lt;br&gt;Sure, our solutions sound complex but our mission is simple: make receipts easy for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💼 &lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;fiskaly is certified to ISO 27001, and our re-certification audit is scheduled for early 2027. We&#39;re looking for an Information Security &amp;amp; Compliance Manager to take end-to-end ownership of our ISMS: close the open nonconformities from our last audit, mature the management system, and lead us through re-certification — then keep raising the bar as we scale across seven European markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an ownership role, not a coordination role. You set the direction — what needs to happen, in which order and why — and you deliver a good part of it yourself: improving processes, running internal audits, preparing evidence and sitting in the room with the auditors. Towards our management team you are the independent expert voice on security and compliance; towards Engineering, Product and Legal you are the hands-on partner who makes controls work in a cloud-native SaaS environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond ISO 27001, you&#39;ll look after our ISO 9001 quality management system and our GDPR framework, and keep us ahead of NIS2 and the AI Act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🛠️ &lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own our ISMS end-to-end — scope, policies, controls, risk register, management review and continuous improvement — and be accountable for its effectiveness, not just its documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead our re-certification in early 2027: assess the current state (previous findings, existing policies and processes, gaps), close the open nonconformities, plan and run internal audits, prepare the management review and the evidence, coordinate with the certification body and be present throughout the audit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and build ISMS processes tailored to fiskaly — business continuity, change management, incident and vulnerability management, supplier management — designed for how a cloud-native engineering team actually works, not copied from a template&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the company-wide risk management programme, translating abstract risks into prioritised, actionable engineering and business tasks, and explaining business risk vs. technical risk to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the independent expert voice towards management: report on the state of security and compliance, explain what our processes are for, and give concrete direction on what to improve and in which order&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering and Product to embed security-by-design into the SDLC, CI/CD and infrastructure-as-code, and move evidence collection from manual gathering to automated, continuous monitoring wherever possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Legal and Sales on customer due diligence: security questionnaires, contract security reviews and enterprise customer audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee vendor risk management with lightweight, scalable assessments that surface third-party risk without stalling procurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain our ISO 9001 QMS and GDPR framework, monitor the regulatory landscape (NIS2, AI Act) and translate it into practical roadmaps for leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a security-aware culture beyond mandatory training — position compliance as a business enabler, not a blocker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;✨ &lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in Information Security, Compliance or Risk Management, with a track record of building or maturing an ISMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have owned at least one ISO 27001 certification, surveillance or re-certification audit end-to-end — from gap assessment and closing nonconformities to sitting across from the auditor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of ISO 27001 (2022) and its controls; working knowledge of ISO 9001 and GDPR; able to navigate NIS2 without hand-holding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine fluency in SaaS and cloud environments: you understand GCP and/or Azure, CI/CD, infrastructure-as-code and modern change management well enough to audit them and to talk to engineers as a peer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of secure SDLC — what good looks like and where the evidence lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong risk management foundations (ISO 31000, COSO or comparable) and the ability to present risk to C-level stakeholders in business terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on, delivery mindset: you define what needs to be done, then do it, scaling your effort to the deadline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills in English (C1); German is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Vienna or willing to relocate, with regular on-site presence and full presence during audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant certifications (ISO 27001 Lead Implementer / Lead Auditor, CISM, CISSP, CISA) and experience with modern GRC platforms (e.g. Vanta, Drata) are strong pluses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A real ownership mandate: you&#39;ll be the person who takes fiskaly through re-certification and shapes how security, quality and compliance work at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly collaborative and international team that values trust, growth, and transparency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid setup with a modern office in Vienna, modern tools, and a strong culture of autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time and budget for continuous learning and certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🌍 &lt;strong&gt;Why fiskaly?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re not just building tech, we&#39;re shaping the future of digital compliance. At fiskaly, we believe in trust, shared vision, and celebrating success together. If you want to make an impact where security meets innovation, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based in Vienna&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Native in English, and German, and a strong plus if you speak Italian, Spanish or French at native or near-native level. More than one is a real advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Entry level, this is a role for someone at the start of their commercial career. No prior sales experience required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; Part-time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Join fiskaly! Help Us Simplify Receipts for Millions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people interact with fiskaly every day, even if they don’t realize it. As a B2B company, we power the retail technology behind digital receipts and secure, legally compliant transactions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By making receipts tamper-proof through digital signatures, we help fight tax fraud. And with our paperless receipt solution, we offer consumers a modern alternative while helping merchants streamline their operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sure, our solutions sound complex but our mission is simple: make receipts easy for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:190;1034-1223&quot;&gt;Three things make up most of this job: calling people who have never heard of fiskaly, working out who is worth calling in the first place, and automating whichever parts you can do better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:351;1225-1575&quot;&gt;The research matters more than the title suggests. When we enter a new market, someone has to map which POS vendors operate there and which of them are worth approaching. That will be you, and the sales team will act on what you find. Those markets are all over Europe, which is why the languages you speak genuinely change what you can take on here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:205;1577-1781&quot;&gt;On the automation side, we use Claude and tools like Make.com. If you can build something that enriches our prospect data faster than a person can, that&#39;s a better use of your afternoon than copy-pasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:142;1783-1924&quot;&gt;The rest is supporting the sales team as things come up: ad hoc requests, trade fair preparation, and topics that cross over into accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🛠️ What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;30:1-30:229;1949-2177&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cold calling and outreach:&lt;/strong&gt; Be the first point of contact for potential customers by phone, email and LinkedIn — consistently, and without needing to be nudged. You&#39;ll work in the language of the market you&#39;re calling into.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-31:240;2178-2417&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead research and market mapping:&lt;/strong&gt; Research competitors and potential customers in markets we&#39;re entering, and turn what you find into reports the sales team can act on — for example, mapping the POS vendor landscape in a new country.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;32:1-32:141;2418-2558&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data enrichment:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep our CRM and prospect data clean, complete and useful — and find smarter ways to enrich it than doing it by hand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;33:1-33:182;2559-2740&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Own dedicated AI projects that make the sales organisation faster. We use Claude and tools like Make.com, and you&#39;ll have the freedom to experiment with new ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;34:1-34:168;2741-2908&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supporting the sales team:&lt;/strong&gt; Take repetitive tasks off the plate of our sales colleagues, react to ad hoc requests, and adapt to whatever the team needs that week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;35:1-35:156;2909-3064&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trade fair planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Help plan and prepare our presence at trade fairs across Europe, from logistics to the target list of who we want to meet there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;36:1-36:176;3065-3240&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-department collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with colleagues across sales and accounting — and across countries — reaching out to customers proactively when a topic requires it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👀 What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;40:1-47:123;3264-4390&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;40:1-40:149;3264-3412&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re not afraid of the phone.&lt;/strong&gt; Cold calling doesn&#39;t put you off. You understand that most calls don&#39;t land, and you make the next one anyway.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;41:1-41:116;3413-3528&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re proactive and self-driven.&lt;/strong&gt; You spot what needs doing and start it, rather than waiting to be assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;42:1-42:103;3529-3631&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You work in a native level in English, and German.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;44:1-44:202;3816-4017&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re curious about what we do.&lt;/strong&gt; Fiscalization, compliance and payments aren&#39;t obvious topics to get excited about, but if the technology behind every receipt interests you, you&#39;ll enjoy it here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;45:1-45:131;4018-4148&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re curious about AI.&lt;/strong&gt; You already play around with AI tools and want to use them for real work, not just to try them out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;46:1-46:119;4149-4267&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with everyday tools.&lt;/strong&gt; Google Workspace and standard office programs hold no surprises for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;47:1-47:123;4268-4390&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open and a team player.&lt;/strong&gt; You bring a positive attitude, ask for help when you need it, and are eager to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;49:1-49:52;4392-4443&quot;&gt;🌍 Languages are an asset here, not a formality&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;51:1-51:300;4445-4744&quot;&gt;We sell across seven European markets, and the person doing this research and outreach hits the limits of their languages fast. Every additional one — German, Italian, Spanish, French, Portuguese, Dutch — widens the set of markets you can map and the prospects you can actually pick up the phone to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;53:1-53:113;4746-4858&quot;&gt;If you&#39;ve studied or worked in more than one country, that&#39;s exactly the kind of background that fits this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅ What We Offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building products that matter, and we know that takes focus, trust, and the right environment. Here’s what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The possibility to grow, to try new things, and to fail and to learn in a supportive and encouraging environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vacation days/year if you are based in Austria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours and a hybrid work arrangement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A public transportation ticket&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company hardware of your choice (Windows, Linux or Mac)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a spacious and bright office close to a subway station (Neubaugasse U3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A vibrant, inclusive company culture that values your well-being and personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✨ Why fiskaly?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work on real problems that have impact, not vanity projects. Our team is pragmatic, direct, and focused on building solid tech for an industry that needs it. We care about how things work, not how they look on paper. If that resonates, you’ll probably enjoy working here.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Job Title: Senior Backend Engineer (Golang)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Preferably in Vienna but open to have someone remote in Austria or in Poland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Languages: English (Fluent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: Over 5 years of experience in backend development using Golang and other OOP languages, you will contribute to our SaaS platform, managing the full software lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract: No freelancing, full time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;462674f1-45aa-4621-9114-7410764c170f&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Millions of people interact with fiskaly every day, even if they don’t realize it. As a B2B company, we power the retail technology behind digital receipts and secure, legally compliant transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;627a7f97-d2b5-4955-b082-fc46bfece227&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;By making receipts tamper-proof through digital signatures, we help fight tax fraud. And with our paperless receipt solution, we offer consumers a modern alternative while helping merchants streamline their operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;ef8b75b7-d712-4826-93b0-6b9f062cc1c5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Sure, our solutions sound complex but our mission is simple: &lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;make receipts easy for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;You are a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Senior Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, but we view you as a System Architect. You will join a high-performing squad responsible for our API-first SaaS solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;Your job is not just to write lines of code; it is to deliver value. We expect you to use every tool in the modern arsenal—including AI coding assistants and automation—to bypass the repetitive parts of software development. This allows you to focus 100% of your brainpower on complex distributed system problems, architecture, and reliability. You will shape the future of our unified interface and ensure our fiscalization platform scales effortlessly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🛠️ What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architect for Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and build resilient, high-performance microservices using Golang, taking full ownership from architecture to deployment (End-to-End).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI-Augmented Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage AI-assisted development tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot, generative AI) to speed up boilerplate creation, write robust unit tests, and auto-generate documentation so you can focus on complex business logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Continuous Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Embrace a &quot;Continuous Everything&quot; (GitOps) approach, deploying code multiple times a day with absolute confidence thanks to automated testing and monitoring pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Evolve the Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Design the unified interface for our services, ensuring our APIs are intuitive, strictly typed, and self-documenting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Innovate with ML/AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Integrate AI and ML capabilities directly into our platform where it adds high value, such as anomaly detection in transaction logs or automated error classification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead &amp;amp; Mentor:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor junior developers—not just on Go syntax, but on how to be highly efficient, tool-augmented engineers in a modern, automated cloud environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✨ What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deep Go Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of full-time Backend Development experience, with a strong preference for Golang and a deep understanding of OOP/SOLID principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Distributed Systems Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; You deeply understand the fallacies of distributed computing, eventual consistency, and exactly how to build fault-tolerant architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A &quot;Force-Multiplier&quot; Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience (or a strong interest) in using AI tools to exponentially enhance software quality and velocity. You don&#39;t just write code; you architect solutions that generate code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cloud Native DNA:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience with Docker and Kubernetes. You aren&#39;t just an app developer; you know exactly how your code lives and breathes in the cluster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;API &amp;amp; Integration Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep knowledge of RESTful and RPC-based APIs (treating API design as a first-class citizen), plus familiarity with asynchronous message systems (RabbitMQ, Kafka, PubSub) and knowing when to use them over synchronous calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cloud Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with cloud platforms (GCP preferred) and modern database strategies (relational vs. NoSQL).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a clear communicator who can break down complex, abstract architectural concepts for both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A culture that encourages you to use the latest tech. If an AI tool helps you code 20% faster, we want you to use it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A supportive environment where you can try new things, fail safely, and learn constantly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours and a hybrid work arrangement (Office in Vienna/Berlin/Madrid/Milan or Remote)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work permit sponsorship for qualified candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dedicated budget for personal and professional development and regular 1:1 career planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company hardware of your choice (Windows, Linux, or Mac)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A vibrant, inclusive company culture that values your well-being and personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles_markdown-mx-auto__wnt62 styles_markdown-content__01TUo&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 Why fiskaly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining fiskaly means contributing to a mission-driven company that is redefining how compliance is done in Europe and beyond. Here, you’ll grow, innovate, and make a real impact on the finance operations of a scaling SaaS company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Job Details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Warsaw, Poland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language requirements: Fluent German, Polish and English (English is our company language). Any other European language is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience level: Senior 5+ years in recruiting, with a significant part of it in-house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employment type: Full-time, permanent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🚀 Join fiskaly! Help Us Simplify Receipts for Millions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people interact with fiskaly every day, even if they don’t realize it. As a B2B company, we power the retail technology behind digital receipts and secure, legally compliant transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By making receipts tamper-proof through digital signatures, we help fight tax fraud. And with our paperless receipt solution, we offer consumers a modern alternative while helping merchants streamline their operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sure, our solutions sound complex but our mission is simple: &lt;strong&gt;make receipts easy for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💼 The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition at fiskaly is still being built, and we want someone to build it with us. You&#39;ll own hiring across very different functions, from engineering and product to sales, finance, legal and people, in all of the countries we operate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our hiring managers will come to you before a search opens, not only once it&#39;s live. You&#39;ll help them decide what the role really needs, what the market can offer, and how we should run the process. Along the way, you&#39;ll help shape how fiskaly hires as a whole.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🛠️ What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-cycle recruiting: Own searches across tech, go-to-market and other functions, from intake and sourcing through offer and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted advisor: Shape role definitions with hiring managers and leadership, challenge requirements, and advise on market, compensation and talent availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive sourcing: Build pipelines for hard-to-fill and senior roles across multiple European markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building TA foundations: Help design and improve our interview processes, scorecards, candidate experience, employer branding and hiring metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New ideas: Bring smart use of AI and automation into how we hire, to make it faster and fairer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;👀 What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve recruited in-house: 5+ years in recruiting, with a significant part of it sitting inside the company you hired for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built or shaped a TA function: You&#39;ve set up processes, tools or the team itself, not only worked within an existing one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve hired through rapid growth: You&#39;ve recruited in a startup or scale-up while it was scaling fast, and you know what that pace demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve covered a broad mix of functions: Tech, sales, finance, product, not a single niche.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You speak fluent German, Polish and English: Both, written and spoken. Another European language (Polish, Italian, Spanish, French, Portuguese) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus points: Experience hiring across several European countries, a background in B2B SaaS, fintech, regtech or another regulated industry, and hands-on work with an ATS such as Greenhouse and with AI tools in recruiting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;✅ What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building products that matter, and we know that takes focus, trust, and the right environment. Here’s what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A senior role with real influence on how a scaling company hires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close collaboration with leadership and a TA team that values ownership and new ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The possibility to grow, to try new things, and to fail and to learn in a supportive and encouraging environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for&amp;nbsp;personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company hardware of your choice (Windows, Linux or Mac)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A vibrant, inclusive company culture that values your well-being and personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;✨ Why fiskaly?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work on real problems that have impact, not vanity projects. Our team is pragmatic, direct, and focused on building solid tech for an industry that needs it. We care about how things work, not how they look on paper.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If that resonates, you’ll probably enjoy working here.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;118&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;121&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Vienna or Warsaw (hybrid)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language requirements:&lt;/strong&gt; Full professional German and English is a must, Spanish, French, or Italian is plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience requirements:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in technical support, pre-sales engineering, QA, or related customer-facing technical roles is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gross salary range:&lt;/strong&gt; 40k–55k/year (depending on experience and qualifications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time under local labor law (no freelancing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;444&quot; data-end=&quot;502&quot;&gt;🚀 Join fiskaly! Help Us Simplify Receipts for Millions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people interact with fiskaly every day, even if they don’t realize it. As a B2B company, we power the retail technology behind digital receipts and secure, legally compliant transactions. In Italy, we help retailers go fully digital and eliminate the need for hardware like fiscal printers to issue and manage receipts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By making receipts tamper-proof through digital signatures, we help fight tax fraud. And with our paperless receipt solution, we offer consumers a modern alternative while helping merchants streamline their operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sure, our solutions sound complex but our mission is simple: make receipts easy for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1158&quot; data-end=&quot;1172&quot;&gt;💼 The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Technical Customer Success Manager&lt;/strong&gt; at fiskaly, you are the go-to person for our customers&#39; technical questions about our solutions for Germany. You bring an interest in technical topics such as APIs and the willingness to get into complex subjects quickly and on your own – from TSE integration to regulatory requirements such as KassenSichV or DSFinV-K.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ll help you build your expertise step by step. What matters is that you take topics on proactively instead of waiting for them to be assigned to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1655&quot; data-end=&quot;1676&quot;&gt;🛠️ What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the bridge between our customers and our Sales and Development teams, bringing your own assessment to each case instead of just passing it on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse technical requests, reproduce errors, spot patterns in recurring customer issues and bring improvement ideas to the team proactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain guides, FAQ articles and documentation wherever you see they&#39;re needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run technical kickoff calls and guide customers through onboarding and the technical integration of our solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape our self-service solution and use your experience to keep improving our support processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;91&quot; data-end=&quot;115&quot;&gt;AI-enhanced support:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, test, and support the adoption of AI tools to improve support workflows, self-service, and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2153&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;👀 What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive way of working: you don&#39;t wait to be handed a task, you see what needs doing and take ownership of it. This matters a lot to us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in technical topics: APIs and how technical systems fit together make you curious&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You learn fast and can get into new, complex topics quickly without losing the overview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to adapt to changing requirements and new topics without losing focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-focused mindset and a knack for explaining complex technical information clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills: you can mediate between technical teams and customers without anything getting lost along the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player who gets involved and shares knowledge with others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native-level German and fluent English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A valid EU work permit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First experience in technical support or customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any other language in addition to German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅ What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured onboarding and the chance to grow step by step into an expert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vacation days per year if you&#39;re based in Vienna&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours and a hybrid setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware of your choice (Windows, Linux or Mac)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A public transport ticket for Vienna or Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a great office in Vienna or Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plenty of opportunities for personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A lively, inclusive company culture that cares about your wellbeing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 Why fiskaly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining fiskaly means contributing to a mission-driven company that is redefining how compliance is done in Europe and beyond. We&#39;re looking for people who think and act independently and enjoy digging into new technical topics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t tick every single box? Apply anyway – we believe in growth, learning and the unique value you bring.&lt;/p&gt;
